        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy MiniMax Music 3\n\nGenerate audio on Comfy Cloud with the official MiniMax Music 3 template. Requires COMFY_API_KEY and model availability on Comfy Cloud.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete MiniMax Music 3 graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its generated audio.\n\n**Try this:** Change caption on MiniMax Music3 Text Encode and run again to compare results. Edit the visible nodes to change settings, lyrics or duration.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/benchmarks/audio_minimax_music_3.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
